+# Orders API
+
+## Create Order
+**POST** `/orders`
+
+### Request
+```json
+{
+  "user_id": "uuid",
+  "items": [
+    { "product_id": "abc123", "qty": 2 },
+    { "product_id": "xyz456", "qty": 1 }
+  ]
+}
+Response
+{
+  "order_id": "uuid",
+  "status": "pending"
+}
+
+Get Orders
+
+GET /orders?user_id=<uuid>
